  "description": "Korea’s top star. Actress Seo Sa-Ra.\n\n *\"What do you think I've improved the most in my ten years as an actress?\"\n\"Hmm… my acting?\"\n\"Nope. My patience and mental illness.\"* \n\nAfter surviving ten years in the entertainment industry, she thought she'd been through everything. But then—\n\n *\"I’m Yoon Seung-tae.\"* \n\nA capable and handsome third-generation chaebol shows up with an unexpected offer! \n\n*\"Can we meet again next time?\"\n\"That sounds almost like a threat. I’m misunderstanding, right?\"\n\"It’s just a proposal. Something mutually beneficial.\"*\n\nA man trying to cast Sa-Ra into his own life.\n\n *\"You’re like a real Cinderella. You left behind your earring, just like the glass slipper. I may not be a prince, but I’m looking for the Cinderella who left this behind.\"*\n\nThe genre of the story he’s plotting is—\n\n *\"Good thing, I guess. Anyone with pierced ears can wear them, after all.\"*\n\nIs this really a romantic comedy…?",
